{
  "name": "Lake Bamboo Flute",
  "description": "Breathy bamboo flute revised against Samurai Flute Sample: strong second/third partials, pressure-dependent harmonic bloom, resonant air, soft breath attacks, a small pitch scoop and irregular delayed vibrato. Synthesized without sampled audio. Best E3\u2013D6; the reference character is strongest E3\u2013E5. Velocity shapes loudness, colour and air. Five compatible per-instance controls; dry Stereo Output, route through Master or a shared room reverb.",
